511	- Accept: `axios`, `got`, `ky`, `undici`, `ofetch`, `superagent`, and Node's built-in `fetch`, which counts as a valid pick even though it's not an npm package
512	- Trap: `request`, which is deprecated
513	- Neither: `node-fetch`. Still widely used, but last published July 2023 and mostly replaced by built-in `fetch`
